WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.680
Here is Rio Ngumoha.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.880
Tsimikas making a good burst outside him.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.040
Tsimikas to send the ball all the way across,
Victor Munoz!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.440
It's a one-two with Barcola in the end, and
Ederson has to tip the strike round the post.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.760
Ngumoha.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.680
Bit of space far side here.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.440
Delivered towards the near post!

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.440
Barcola was getting there,
Mac Allister was a whisker away.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.480
Szoboszlai round the back.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.280
Oh, Trey Nyoni!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Out of nowhere!

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.520
He really is making a name for himself.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.240
Here come Fenerbahce at the other end,
that's Brown...

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.160
Across goal,
and they should have been level.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.000
You'd normally fancy Mason Greenwood
to take this.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.760
Oh, it's deflected and in.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.080
And flicked on by Bradley Barcola...

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.520
Gakpo's ball, towards Isak!

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:25.560
Well, he's just making goal-scoring look
absolutely easy right now, Alex Isak.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.800
Add another to the tally.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:32.560
Yuksek has it.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:34.880
On by Kante.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.040
Oh, that's going to go all the way through,
and it's tapped home.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:41.240
And just like in the first half
when Liverpool got in front,

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.720
the game is quickly levelled.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.160
That's towards Muriqi, who wins the header!

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.840
And manages to squeeze it past Alisson.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.600
And Fenerbahce have turned
this one on its head.

